  "experiment": "animacy_common_direction_decoder",
  "description": "Leakage-safe leave-one-out decoding of animate/inanimate labels from the common direction m=(mu_animate+mu_inanimate)/2. Axes are recomputed inside each training fold. A 1D threshold and polarity are fitted on training projections only. The script also reports an orthogonalized common-axis control, the standard difference-axis reference, and a norm-only global magnitude control.",
